- op: discuss  # cdf6
  at: '2026-05-28T03:28:05Z'  # cdf6
  by: agent  # cdf6
  actor: jgstern_agent  # cdf6
  clock: 3  # cdf6
  nonce: cdf6  # cdf6
  message: "Drift guard added in PR #3952. The property test (TestBridgeLinkerConstraintConsistency::test_every_bridge_linker_with_pairs_and_depends_on_is_consistent) reads each linker's module-docstring subcategory marker (per ADR-0003-ext §2) and, for every Bridge linker declaring both activation.language_pairs and depends_on, asserts the CNF derived from the pairs (after language→pass-id resolution via the live _ANALYZER_REGISTRY) equals the declared depends_on. Currently green for all 10 Bridge linkers (cgo, jni, lua-ffi, napi, pyffi, ruby-ffi, solidity-abi, swift-objc, tauri-ipc, wasm-bindgen). Adding an impl language to one declaration but not the other will now fail CI."  # cdf6
